<title>USA: Lincoln National Corp Q4 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Lincoln National Corp Q4 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WAYNE, Ind. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.37		    $0.72</p>
<p> Net			142,781		   75,136</p>
<p> Revs		   1,751,956		1,834,876</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 104,481		  104,500</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 operating income $127.1 million or $1.22 a share vs $9.4 million or $0.09 a share. 1995 Q4 includes a special charge of $121.6 million for disability income reserve strengthening.</p>
<p>		   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $4.91		    $4.63</p>
<p> Net			513,558		  482,186</p>
<p> Revs		   6,721,270		6,633,256</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 104,561		  104,116</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year operating income $434.1 million or $4.15 a share vs $306.5 million or $2.94 a share.</p>
</text>
